Subject: How to know which semilandmark is symmetric relative to which semilandmark when I have thousands of semilandmarks?
Message-ID: <qLGtSYZhowY.VlWBdyLhCAAJ@geomorph-r-package.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/geomorph-r-package/c/qLGtSYZhowY/m/VlWBdyLhCAAJ>
